### Notable changes

* v0.3.4: Add a `job-wait-for-mcp` Job (sync-wave -2, before the node-labeling
          Job at -1 and the StorageCluster) that waits for the configured
          MachineConfigPools (default: `worker`) to finish reconciling before
          any nodes are labeled and the StorageCluster is created. Labeling
          nodes for ODF can trigger an MCO rolling reboot, and forming Ceph
          monitors mid-rollout can strand monitor PVCs in the wrong
          availability zone. Controlled by `waitForMcp.enabled` (default
          `true`), `waitForMcp.pools`, and `waitForMcp.timeout`.
          All Jobs (and the node-labeling CronJob) are now drain-cancelable:
          they trap SIGTERM and exit nonzero so a cancelled run is never
          marked successful, and `podFailurePolicy` ignores drain evictions
          (DisruptionTarget) so a replacement pod resumes the wait instead of
          burning backoffLimit. Job grace periods reduced 400s to 60s.

* v0.3.3: Only emit `preparePlacement` when overridden. Otherwise the application may go out-of-sync on ArgoCD.

* v0.3.2: Make `preparePlacement` configurable.

* v0.3.1: Make `objectStorage.enable`: `false` cover more resources.

* v0.3.0: Replace `global.datacenter.storageClassName` with `odf.osd.pvc.storageClassName`.
          When unset, the OSD storage class is derived from `global.clusterPlatform`
          (AWS: `gp3-csi`, Azure: `managed-csi`, GCP: `standard-csi`).
          This is a backwards-incompatible change.
          Also add a CronJob that periodically re-runs the same node-labeling
          logic as the bootstrap Job (same useSpecificNodes / selector conditions).

* v0.2.3: Allow passing of label selector to labelling job to avoid, for example, labelling submariner nodes.
          Also ensure at least 3 nodes are labelled when using label selector.

* v0.2.2: Reconfigure sync ordering to ensure label job runs before attempts to create storagecluster/storagesystem

* v0.2.1: Introduce boolean to configure where mirroring is enabled. Needed for RamenDR. Defaults to false

